<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

    <!-- $title = FOLIO.txt -->
    <!-- $desc = I'm Cameron Murray, a graphic designer with a knack for jumping between branding, digital design, and motion. -->

    <!-- @import 'head.kit' -->

    <body class="home dark">

        <!-- @import 'header.kit' -->

        <div class="main">
            <div class="home-splash">
                <div id="scroll-scale"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="home-intro typewriter">
                <h1>I’m Cameron Murray, a graphic designer (among other things) with a knack for jumping between branding, digital design, motion and whatever else a project throws my way. I like mixing creative thinking with a bit of tech to make work that’s both thoughtful and&nbsp;engaging.</h1>
            </div>

            <div class="home-projects">
                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-left text-bottom image-on-top">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/new-junction/">
                        <img src="/new-junction/images/new-junction-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>New Junction</h3>
                            <p>Midland’s seldom used oval laying at its heart was primed for transformation into a new meeting place that would become the town’s new backyard. The New Junction brand aims to bring new life and energy to the heritage of&nbsp;Midland.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-bottom">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/black-swan-2020/">
                        <img src="/black-swan-2020/images/black-swan-2020-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>Black Swan 2020 Season Campaign</h3>
                            <p>Black Swan State Theatre's 2020 Season campaign, Stories from Here, was created to take audiences on a road trip around Western Australia. Taking inspiration from scrapbooks, travel journals, road directories and, even old telephone books, with colour sampled directly from the&nbsp;land.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-mid">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/showroom-x/">
                        <img src="/showroom-x/images/showroom-x-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>Showroom-X</h3>
                            <p>A sophisticated Brand Identity and creative platform that connected Showroom-X with a Chinese audience, and showcased our uniquely Australian approach to high consumer&nbsp;fashion.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-bottom">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/wanderland/">
                        <img src="/wanderland/images/wanderland-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>WAnderland</h3>
                            <p>WAnderland is the down under answer to Alice in Wonderland. A playground for people who have never been able to leave a locked room alone, a page unturned, or an over grown trail&nbsp;ignored.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-mid">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/karrinyup/">
                        <img src="/karrinyup/images/karrinyup-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>Karrinyup Spring/Summer 20/21</h3>
                            <p>Aligned with Karrinyup’s own metamorphosis while their rennovations were underway, we sought to express this joy in Karrinyup Shopping Centre’s SS20/21 campaign idea – ‘Renew&nbsp;You’.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-bottom">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/till-death/">
                        <img src="/till-death/images/till-death-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>TILL DEATH Web</h3>
                            <p>An unconventional website focused on the exhibition of their films brings the party, utilising motion and energy to create an identity that is more sophisticated, edgy as ever and just damn&nbsp;fun.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-left text-bottom">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/the-fame-project/">
                        <img src="/the-fame-project/images/the-fame-project-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>The Fame Project</h3>
                            <p>Talent and drive know no boundaries, but unfortunately opportunity can. FAME needed a brand to bring film, art, music and entertainment technology and expertise to remote communities all in a state-of-the-art music and video studio; on the back of a&nbsp;truck.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-bottom">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/take1/">
                        <img src="/take1/images/take1-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>TAKE1 Youth Screen Festival</h3>
                            <p>A creative festival for the smartphone generation of aspiring filmmakers. From the name to its identity – TAKE1 Youth Screen Festival ditched the tired film clichés and embraced new media to aim itself at its young, always-on&nbsp;audience.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-bottom">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/sorted-futures/">
                        <img src="/sorted-futures/images/sorted-futures-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>Sorted Futures</h3>
                            <p>A brand that challenges what a not-for-profit can look like, and what they can do for kids in remove areas of&nbsp;WA.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-bottom">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/road-train-domain/">
                        <img src="/road-train-domain/images/road-train-domain-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>Road Train Domain</h3>
                            <p>A campaign built around three simple rules for safely sharing the road with road trains. The idea was to establish regional WA as a different driving environment, where understanding these rules is&nbsp;essential.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="project-item watch-scroll text-left text-bottom">
                    <a class="draggable" href="/st-catherines/">
                        <img src="/st-catherines/images/st-catherines-thumb.webp">
                        <div class="project-info-wrapper">
                            <h3>St Catherine’s College WEB</h3>
                            <p>Translating the new St Catherine’s identity into a dynamic, heavily customised Squarespace website built around the idea of a student’s “first chapter” inspired by book spines and elements of the college&nbsp;crest.</p>
                            <p class="project-link dotted after-arrow">Look</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- @import 'footer.kit' -->

    </body>
</html>
